                            <comment id="14999588" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 10 Nov 2015 23:31:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Leemoonsoo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-410&quot; title=&quot;Autoscroll should not do horizontal scroll&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-410&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-410&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Autoscroll only in y axis&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Addresses &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-410&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-410&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    Autoscroll scrolls not only vertical, but also horizontal scrollbar. but horizontal scrollbar should not be touched from it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-410&quot; title=&quot;Autoscroll should not do horizontal scroll&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-410&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-410&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #419&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 214de49ce008f3bd7ba46e74f914248ea62fc67b&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Lee moon soo &amp;lt;moon@apache.org&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2015-11-10T23:29:54Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Autoscroll only in y axis&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14999762" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 11 Nov 2015 01:29:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user corneadoug commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155625519&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155625519&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Any easy way to reproduce this, for me to test this PR?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14999786" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 11 Nov 2015 01:51:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155629746&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155629746&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Create output larger than paragraph width, eg&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    println(&quot;&quot;&quot;%html &amp;lt;div style=&quot;width:2000px;border:1px solid gray&quot;&amp;gt;output&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;)&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    and create other paragraphs a head of it, long enough to trigger scroll.&lt;br/&gt;
    And then you&apos;ll see horizontal scroll when you trigger scroll to this paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="15000289" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 11 Nov 2015 12:02:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user gauravkumar37 commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155758062&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155758062&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Thanks @Leemoonsoo, seems to fix the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15001673" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 12 Nov 2015 04:27:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user corneadoug commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155994506&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155994506&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Fixing the issue indeed.&lt;br/&gt;
    Good to Merge!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    However this way of reproducing the error is showing another bug in Zeppelin:&lt;br/&gt;
    The result content should be restricted to the container, and not breaking outside of it&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15001676" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 12 Nov 2015 04:34:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155995083&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/419#issuecomment-155995083&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Thanks @gauravkumar37 and @corneadoug for review.&lt;br/&gt;
    I&apos;m merging it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    @corneadoug Right, result should be restricted to the container. Can you file an issue?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15001682" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 12 Nov 2015 04:39:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user corneadoug commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

